  "prefLabel": "Inst 402.03 Reporting Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Inst 402.03 Reporting Requirements. A licensed program shall report any changes in information provided in the most recent application to the OPLC, in writing, no later than 90 days after the change.\n\nSource. #8494, eff 12-24-05; ss by #10115, eff 4-14-12, EXPIRED: 4-15-22\n\nNew. #14112, eff 1-17-25 (formerly Inst 301.08); ss by #14426, eff 1-16-26, EXPIRES 1-16-36 (formerly Inst 301.06)",
